        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>地球圈层结构</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      color: #222;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 2;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 17px 18px 24px 18px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    p {\n      margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    }\n\n    .numbered {\n      padding-left: 5px;\n      text-indent: 0;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 1px 0 0 0;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n\n    .subitem {\n      padding-left: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .chapter-title {\n      margin: 25px 0 8px 0;\n      color: #d82b35;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .marked {\n      color: #d82b35;\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 3px;\n    }\n\n    table {\n      width: 100%;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      border: 1px solid #777;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 2.05;\n    }\n\n    col.label-column {\n      width: 38px;\n    }\n\n    col.feature-column {\n      width: 205px;\n    }\n\n    col.meaning-column {\n      width: auto;\n    }\n\n    th,\n    td {\n      border: 1px solid #888;\n      padding: 1px 7px;\n      vertical-align: top;\n      font-weight: normal;\n    }\n\n    thead th {\n      height: 27px;\n      padding: 0 5px;\n      text-align: center;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .circle-label {\n      padding: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      line-height: 2.35;\n    }\n\n    .circle-label span {\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .atmosphere-row {\n      height: 96px;\n    }\n\n    .hydrosphere-row {\n      height: 96px;\n    }\n\n    .biosphere-row {\n      height: 142px;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-text {\n      margin-top: 0;\n      line-height: 2.2;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <p class=\"numbered\">（2）地幔分为<span class=\"marked\">上地幔</span>和<span class=\"marked\">下地幔</span>。上地幔上部一定范围内的岩石因高温呈熔融状态，该部位被称为<span class=\"marked\">软流层</span>，该层被认为是<span class=\"marked\">岩浆</span>发源地。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"numbered\">（3）<span class=\"marked\">地壳和软流层以上的地幔部分</span>，由<span class=\"marked\">岩石</span>组成，统称为岩石圈。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"section-title\">3.地核</p>\n    <p class=\"subitem\">（1）外核物质接近<span class=\"marked\">液</span>态，主要是由铁、镍等元素组成的熔融体。</p>\n    <p class=\"subitem\">（2）内核物质可能为<span class=\"marked\">固</span>态，刚性很强，由在极高压状态下结晶的铁镍合金组成，密度极<span class=\"marked\">大</span>。</p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"chapter-title\">二、关于“地球外部圈层”</h2>\n\n    <table>\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"label-column\">\n        <col class=\"feature-column\">\n        <col class=\"meaning-column\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th></th>\n          <th>特　点</th>\n          <th>对地球环境的意义</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"atmosphere-row\">\n          <td class=\"circle-label\">\n            <span>大</span>\n            <span>气</span>\n            <span>圈</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            由<span class=\"marked\">干洁空气、水汽和固体杂质</span>组成；<br>\n            <span class=\"marked\">厚度大</span>，具有连续性；<br>\n            分布不均，50%的气体集中在0-6千米的低空大气层（<span class=\"marked\">对流层</span>）中。\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            大气圈能调节地球温度，避免流星体撞击地球，吸收大部分紫外线和高能带电粒子流，保护地球生命。\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"hydrosphere-row\">\n          <td class=\"circle-label\">\n            <span>水</span>\n            <span>圈</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            以<span class=\"marked\">气态、液态、固态</span>三种形式存在于空气中、地表和地下。具有连续性，分布不均，主要分布在<span class=\"marked\">海洋</span>。是地球特有的圈层。\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"marked\">拥有水圈</span>是地球特有的环境优势；<br>\n            水圈能调节气候（降低温差）、净化大气、塑造地表形态（如<span class=\"marked\">流水</span>地貌、<span class=\"marked\">喀斯特</span>地貌、<span class=\"marked\">海岸</span>地貌）；<br>\n            是地球生命存在和人类延续和发展的必要条件\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"biosphere-row\">\n          <td class=\"circle-label\">\n            <span>生</span>\n            <span>物</span>\n            <span>圈</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            是地球上所有<span class=\"marked\">生物及其生存环境</span>的总称；<br>\n            生物圈的核心层（生物层）位于<span class=\"marked\">地表以上100米到水下200米</span>的大气圈、水圈、岩石圈的交界处。\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            生物圈是大气圈、水圈、岩石圈<span class=\"marked\">相互渗透、相互作用</span>的结果；<br>\n            生物圈参与对大气圈、水圈和岩石圈的改造，对地表物质循环、能量转换具有特殊作用。<br>\n            生物圈是地球上<span class=\"marked\">最大</span>的生态系统，是<span class=\"marked\">地球</span>独有的圈层。\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <p class=\"bottom-text\">大气圈、水圈、生物圈、岩石圈相互<span class=\"marked\">联系</span>、相互<span class=\"marked\">渗透</span>、相互<span class=\"marked\">影响</span>，形成人类赖以生存和发展的自然环境。</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
